>\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          橙子、柚子、杏干、茉莉乌龙茶感\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          Orange, Pomelo, Dried apricot, Jasmine-oolong tea like\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           这个批次是我们第一次接触到艾力达的暗房干燥批次，从入口的感受来说它还是很传统的风味，柑橘，茶感，可能是因为暗房慢速干燥，它的甜感很扎实，甚至触感都有比以往传统水洗更为的厚实圆润的感受，中后段还会感受到一些杏脯和乌龙茶感，好喝的！\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TUpK9f4hazHxsh8ibjCDZ5iaqIjoUKJbvCQ0z31Z2PA1v6NmIdqwXI1iaKpAZqK9gqzpE5JlEvxeQwg/640?wx_fmt=webp&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TUpK9f4hazHxsh8ibjCDZ5iaYXrKOElYAfz0YGfrxNY847s5XQeyfXsH5k25BGlZ3ZucHMbI8v5kHw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(61, 167, 66);\">\n<span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong style='max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(178, 178, 178);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n             以下资料来自台湾守成 Haru Coffee\n            </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;border-width: 0px;border-style: initial;border-color: initial;font-family: inherit;font-style: inherit;font-variant-caps: inherit;font-weight: 700;font-stretch: inherit;line-height: inherit;vertical-align: baseline;color: rgb(50, 50, 50);font-size: 14px;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n           巴拿马 拉马斯特家族　Panama Lamastus Family Estates\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n           位于巴拿马，坐落于知名精品咖啡产区波魁特內的Lamastus家族，旗下分別有艾力达达庄园(Elida Estate)、驴子庄园(El Burro Estate)以及路易多庄园(Luito Gesha Estate)三個带有各自特色的庄园，目前由第三以及第四代庄园主Wilford Lamastus和Wilford Lamastus Jr.所经营，Lamastus家族的咖啡世代至今已有百年的传承。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SnlODiaTrnTuwU9kZrhghs3UQsYs9nmfQvOwXxfm7MsnIqLLgoOFUTvb1Uf4tyAN3Um2wpr1J9Q9A/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n           Wilford分享能够產出品质卓越的超級精品咖啡，要归功于以下的先天优越条件:\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n           1.肥沃的火山土壤\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n           2.微气候天气变化\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n           3.高海拔种植环境\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n           4.优良的原始森林\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n           5.极具特色微批次\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;border-width: 0px;border-style: initial;border-color: initial;font-family: inherit;font-style: inherit;font-variant-caps: inherit;font-weight: 700;font-stretch: inherit;line-height: inherit;vertical-align: baseline;color: rgb(50, 50, 50);font-size: 14px;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n           巴拿马 艾力达庄园　Panama Elida Estate\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n           艾力达(Elida Estate)海拔高度相当高，批次平均约落在1700~1800m之間，庄园本身就在国家公园保留区內，庄园內一直保持着非常原始的林相，同时也保留许多原生树种和可供食用的番茄、梅果树。艾利达庄园內由于环境保护的关系，因此并未铺设柏油路面，在庄园內，随着海拔越來越高，气温降低的幅度非常明显，而低温凉爽的气温加上遮阴树的保护也提供咖啡树相当好好的栽种环境。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SnlODiaTrnTuwU9kZrhghs3TdK9EIcK3Aneq4kJVCKoMiau1iaicQ0dbuMJTGq2EicE11SNCRSr1nOIFA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span>\n           除了对于庄园环境的严格维护之外，Wilford也实验了相当多种的日晒方式，有传统日晒棚架、现代化棚架、庭院式曝晒、遮蔽式干燥以及机械式干燥以及近几年开始实施的暗房干燥；在日晒干燥的阶段，Wilford都要求员工手选仔细挑除不够好的瑕疵豆，此外在批次上艾力达庄园也划分的相当仔细，每一批从庄园采收下来的红果都会填上不同编号，方便后续杯测阶段追踪批次品质和风味水准。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SnlODiaTrnTuwU9kZrhghs3R68Y6Dy4FhP8lgx1PjaRXeAV8D65zmEkBlSZxlAGUdC6eVkxcfuQ2g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n            获奖记录\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           2016 BOP\n           <a class=\"wx_topic_link\" data-topic=\"1\" style=\"color: #576B95 !important;\" topic-id=\"mfdqyla7-svn0yz\">\n            #1\n           </a>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           2018 BOP\n           <a class=\"wx_topic_link\" data-topic=\"1\" style=\"color: #576B95 !important;\" topic-id=\"mfdqyla9-3mnphn\">\n            #1\n           </a>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           2019 BOP\n           <a class=\"wx_topic_link\" data-topic=\"1\" style=\"color: #576B95 !important;\" topic-id=\"mfdqyla9-aihxzo\">\n            #1\n           </a>\n</span>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n<span>\n           2020 BOP 日晒组\n           <a class=\"wx_topic_link\" data-topic=\"1\" style=\"color: #576B95 !important;\" topic-id=\"mfdqyla9-s4pd1b\">\n            #6\n           </a>\n           ,\n           <a class=\"wx_topic_link\" data-topic=\"1\" style=\"color: #576B95 !important;\" topic-id=\"mfdqyla9-p3o1r6\">\n            #9\n           </a>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           2020 BOP 水洗组\n           <a class=\"wx_topic_link\" data-topic=\"1\" style=\"color: #576B95 !important;\" topic-id=\"mfdqyla9-3hathh\">\n            #2\n           </a>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\n            庄园官网的视频（看看风景）\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmecoa.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmecoa_jpg%2FGr457cyFia7TUpK9f4hazHxsh8ibjCDZ5ia4PasTNWp8PxxZsyeOza3NTUYfnfaK9RXDsSrDMsF3RR6ibnQbXm97nQ%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4159153573739249685\" data-ratio=\"1.7777777777777777\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4159153573739249685\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-w=\"1920\">\n</iframe>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n           公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span>\n           客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"10000\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
